## 📋 Common Tasks

### Create New API Endpoint
1. Define Pydantic models (request/response)
2. Create route handler in `/app/api/`
3. Add business logic in `/app/services/` (if complex)
4. Register router in `main.py`
5. Test with `/docs` (Swagger UI)
6. Create TypeScript API client in `frontend/services/`

### Create Database Migration
```bash
cd backend
docker compose exec backend alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"
docker compose exec backend alembic upgrade head
```

### Add New Worker Task
1. Define task in `/app/services/*_worker.py`
2. Use `@celery_app.task` decorator
3. Return structured result dict
4. Test task execution
5. Add to API endpoint for triggering

